# Section Specifications

## 1. Navbar

- Sticky, backdrop-blur on scroll
- Logo left, navigation links center, phone CTA right
- Phone number always visible — local Sofia number format: 0 XX XXX XXXX
- Mobile: hamburger menu
- Nav links: anchor links to #advantage, #process, #faq, #pricing

## 2. Hero

- Full viewport height (min-h-screen)
- Headline: "Топ 3 в Google за 90 дни — гарантирано" (large, bold)
- Subheadline: 75% stat as a fear hook
- Two CTAs: Primary "Вземи безплатен анализ" + Secondary "Обади се"
- Social proof bar: 3 stats (clients, years, guarantee)
- Background: warm beige (#F5F0EB) consistent with the rest of the page

## 3. The Advantage (3 Pillars)

- Section title: "Защо Google Maps?"
- 3 cards: Видимост / Безплатно / Дългосрочно
- Each card has icon, title, 2-3 sentence explanation
- Same warm beige page background; cards are white with subtle shadow/border

## 4. Before / After

- Two-panel comparison — left (before), right (after)
- Metrics: Средна позиция / Пазарен дял / Кликове/месец / Клиенти/месец
- Use real-looking Sofia business example (e.g., "ВиК Сервиз София")
- Animated counter for "after" numbers on scroll into view

## 5. Process (4 Steps)

- Numbered steps: 01–04
- 01: Безплатен анализ, 02: Онбординг, 03: Изпълнение, 04: Проследяване
- Keep each step description to 2 sentences max
- Clean, minimal layout — no icons needed

## 6. FAQ (Accordion)

- 5–6 questions
- Key questions: SEO vs Google Ads / Колко бързо ще видя резултат / Имате ли договор / Как да започнем
- Smooth open/close animation via Framer Motion

## 7. Pricing (3 Tiers)

- Минимум / Стандарт / Най-изгодно
- Highlight "Стандарт" as recommended (border accent, badge)
- Guarantee badge on top 2 plans (green checkmark + "Гаранция за връщане на пари")
- CTA per card: "Започни сега" + "Обади се"
- Note: pricing in BGN (Bulgarian Lev) — approximately match GBP rates
  - Минимум: 500 лв./месец
  - Стандарт: 650 лв./месец
  - Тримесечно: 1650 лв./тримесечие (спести 300 лв.)

## 8. Footer

- Logo + tagline
- Links: Terms / Privacy
- Copyright
- Email contact
